on.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a></div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> + <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">2d6 + 6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Projectile_CursedTome_CurriculumofStrategy</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_CursedTome_CurriculumofStrategy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_CursedTome_CurriculumofStrategy\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasHighGroundRangeExtension_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasHighGroundRangeExtension (spell flag)\">HasHighGroundRangeExtension</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a> with <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 5 Spell Slots</a> can <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Artistry_of_War\" title=\"Scroll of Artistry of War\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Scroll_of_Artistry_of_War_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Artistry_of_War_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Scroll_of_Artistry_of_War_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Artistry_of_War_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Scroll_of_Artistry_of_War_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Artistry_of_War_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Scroll_of_Artistry_of_War_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Artistry_of_War_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Scroll_of_Artistry_of_War_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Artistry_of_War\" title=\"Scroll of Artistry of War\">Scroll of Artistry of War</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The scroll is obtained by reading <a href=\"/wiki/The_Red_Knight%27s_Final_Strategem\" title=\"The Red Knight's Final Strategem\">The Red Knight's Final Strategem</a> in the vault of <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Sundries\" title=\"Sorcerous Sundries\">Sorcerous Sundries</a>. The book can be found at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;368&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1057</span>, behind a wall north of the entry portal to the vault, either locked behind a hidden button (requires a DC 15 Perception check to reveal) or accessed from the Vault button in <a href=\"/wiki/Ramazith%27s_Tower\" title=\"Ramazith's Tower\">Ramazith's Tower</a>.</li>\n<li>This spell can be considered a significantly more powerful version of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/20px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/30px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/40px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Missile\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/20px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\">Magic Missile</a>. When upcast with a <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 5 Spell Slot</a>, Magic Missile does 7d4+7 (14~35) force damage across 7 projectiles, dealing 24.5 force damage on average. Artistry of War does 12d6+36 (48~108) force damage across 6 projectiles, dealing 78 force damage on average.\n<ul><li>Like Magic Missile, this spell's projectiles hit without any attack roll and can curve around obstacles and terrain to hit targets without line of sight.</li>\n<li>Unlike Magic Missile, this spell is not blocked by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_(spell)\" title=\"Shield (spell)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Shield_spell_Icon.webp/20px-Shield_spell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Shield_spell_Icon.webp/30px-Shield_spell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Shield_spell_Icon.webp/40px-Shield_spell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shield\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Shield_spell_Icon.webp/20px-Shield_spell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Shield_spell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_(spell)\" title=\"Shield (spell)\">Shield</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>This spell can only be cast once per <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">short rest</a> and cannot be upcast with a <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 6 Spell Slot</a>. This recharge time cannot normally be avoided, even with a free cast feature like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Battery\" title=\"Arcane Battery\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Arcane_Battery_Passive_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Arcane_Battery_Passive_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Arcane_Battery_Passive_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Battery_Passive_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Arcane_Battery_Passive_Feature_Icon.webp/40px-Arcane_Battery_Passive_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Battery\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Arcane_Battery_Passive_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Arcane_Battery_Passive_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Arcane_Battery_Passive_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Battery\" title=\"Arcane Battery\">Arcane Battery</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Freecast\" title=\"Freecast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Freecast_Icon.webp/20px-Freecast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Freecast_Icon.webp/30px-Freecast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Freecast_Icon.webp/40px-Freecast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Freecast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Freecast_Icon.webp/20px-Freecast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Freecast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Freecast\" title=\"Freecast\">Freecast</a>.</li>\n<li>The incantation for Curriculum of Strategy: Artistry of War is <b>Pario</b>, Latin for <i>\"Bring forth\"</i>, <i>\"Produce\"</i>, or <i>\"Create\"</i>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Despite originating from a spell, damage from this spell is dealt as if from a <a href=\"/wiki/Resistances#Resistance\" title=\"Resistances\">non-magical source</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035418\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.107 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.111 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4297/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89681/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 38716/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.027/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1362941/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n106.47%   87.461     67 Template:Trim\n100.00%   82.144      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   82.144      1 -total\n 31.07%   25.522     10 Template:Icon_text\n 28.16%   23.128      8 Template:Icon_link\n 15.95%   13.099      1 Template:Feature